@startuml "Clôture d'événement et génération de rapports"

title Processus de clôture d'événement et génération automatique de rapports

actor "Contrôleur\n(Staff événement)" as Controller
participant "App Mobile\n(Scan QR)" as MobileApp
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Event Service" as EventSvc
participant "Analytics Service" as AnalyticsSvc
participant "Notification Service" as NotifSvc
participant "Email Service" as EmailSvc
participant "Storage" as Storage
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Rapports de fin d'événement ==
Controller -> MobileApp: Clôturer événement
MobileApp -> API: POST /api/events/{eventId}/close
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions organisateur
Auth --> API: access granted

== Clôture de l'événement ==
API -> EventSvc: closeEvent(eventId)
EventSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: generateEventReport(eventId)

== Génération du rapport ==
AnalyticsSvc -> DB: Complex analytics query
note right: - Total validations\n- No-shows\n- Peak hours\n- Staff performance
DB --> AnalyticsSvc: complete event data

AnalyticsSvc -> AnalyticsSvc: Generate comprehensive report
AnalyticsSvc -> Storage: Save report PDF
Storage --> AnalyticsSvc: report URL

== Envoi du rapport ==
AnalyticsSvc -> NotifSvc: sendEventReport(organizerId, reportUrl)
NotifSvc -> EmailSvc: Send event summary email

== Finalisation ==
EventSvc -> DB: UPDATE events SET status='completed', completedAt=NOW()
EventSvc --> API: event closed
API --> MobileApp: event closure confirmed
MobileApp --> Controller: "Événement clôturé\nRapport envoyé par email"

note over Controller: Le rapport comprend :\n• Statistiques de présence\n• Analyse des pics d'affluence\n• Performance du staff\n• Incidents de sécurité\n• Recommandations

@enduml